WEBVTT

00:00:28.163 --> 00:00:32.329
whether it's making hiring practices more
inclusive or limiting the plastic waste

00:00:32.329 --> 00:00:35.621
and packaging materials work, stopping
the spread of misinformation.

00:00:36.162 --> 00:00:40.162
We all have a role to play in today's
episode is all about how to catalyze

00:00:40.162 --> 00:00:44.162
change. How do you get people to try
something new when they're already very

00:00:44.162 --> 00:00:47.121
familiar and very comfortable
with these well-worn paths?

00:00:48.079 --> 00:00:51.121
Well, Franklin Leonard managed
to do just that in Hollywood.

00:00:51.704 --> 00:00:53.787
He created The Blacklist. It's a list of

00:00:53.787 --> 00:00:56.871
the unproduced screenplays that Hollywood
insiders love the most.

00:00:57.287 --> 00:00:59.912
And in doing so, he changed the
way that Hollywood worked.